<title>HONG KONG: Morgan Stanley sets New World warrants.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets New World warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd said it launched on Thursday 70 million warrants on shares of New World Development Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p>    STRIKE PRICE     HK$44.73	PREMIUM	    13 PCT</p>
<p>    ISSUE PRICE	HK$1.1431     GEARING	    4.3x</p>
<p>    EXPIRATION	 05.JUN.98     SETTLEMENT DATE  20.JUN.97</p>
<p>    LISTING	    HONG KONG     LISTING DATE     25.JUN.97</p>
<p>    BOARD LOT	  10,000	  SPOT REFERENCE   HK$49.70</p>
<p>    GOVERNING LAW    HONG KONG</p>
<p>    NOTE		 IN THE EVENT THAT THE CLOSING PRICE OF THE</p>
<p>			   UNDERLYING ON AUGUST 5, 1997 FALLS TO OR</p>
<p>			   BELOW HK$39.76, THE STRIKE PRICE WILL BE</p>
<p>			   RESET TO HK$39.76.</p>
<p>			   EXERCISE WILL BE FOR PHYSICAL SHARES AT ANY</p>
<p>			   TIME FROM LISTING DATE TO MATURITY, OR IN</p>
<p>			   CASH AT ISSUER'S OPTION.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
